3) How should one go about practicing their skills in Python for data analysis?
4) Is there a specific library or tool that is commonly used for data analysis in Python?
5) What are some good practices and tips for improving my Python programming skills as a beginner?
6) Are there any online platforms where I can practice coding problems to improve my problem-solving skills? 
7) How do you ensure the quality of your work when doing Data Analysis with Python?
8) Is it possible to learn data analysis using Python without knowing how to code in general?
